  ['Process & machining','Draft process and machining-program review for supported geometry','Stock and finished-part 3D drawings provide the basis for draft processes, tools and machining programs. Engineers review geometry, toolpaths and code together.','Stock and finished-part 3D drawings / Volume / Equipment conditions','Draft processes, tools and machining programs, with review items','Reviewed machining conditions inform production and logistics planning.','Actual product screen · Internal demonstration','Process and NC view combining 3D geometry, toolpaths and machining code','Drafts cover supported geometry. Machine use requires engineering and safety review, followed by on-site validation.','Actual Flowmatic process and NC screen with process steps, 3D machining geometry, toolpaths and code.'],
  ['Production & logistics','Throughput and waiting-time comparison across machining, transport and washing','Faster machines may not increase total output when the next process creates a queue. Material supply, transport and shared washing are evaluated together to compare alternatives.','Machining conditions / Equipment configuration / Supply, transport and washing','Projected output, waiting time and work-in-process by scenario','The selected plan informs factory layout and production preparation.','Actual product screen · Separate simulation example','Equipment layout, shared logistics and throughput/waiting comparisons','24.28 → 25.65 parts/h is an internal projection for specific assumptions, not a customer result. Waiting can increase in individual cells.','Actual Flowmatic cell and logistics simulation with seven cells, shared transport paths and cycle, waiting and inventory charts.'],
  ['Layout & approval','Available-space review and production-management handover','Existing workplaces and free space are reviewed alongside a proposed layout. After an operator approves it, the location and process/equipment criteria are transferred to production management.','Existing workplace layout / Available space / Reviewed new plan','Workplace registration linked to location and process criteria','The registered workplace supports production preparation and operations.','Actual product screen · Internal demonstration','Production handover with existing workplaces in blue and the proposed layout in yellow','This is software workplace registration and plan handover. It is not machine start-up or safety approval.','Actual Flowmatic handover screen with existing workplaces, free space, a yellow proposed layout and an approval control.'],
  ['Production operations','Selected plans linked to workplace operating standards','Factory, workplace and line status are shown on the same layout. Production units and process criteria provide a common reference for the next person taking over the work.','Approved workplace / Process criteria / Production unit','Workplace production status and references for related tasks','Connecting shop-floor data to compare forecasts and actuals is a validation objective.','Actual product screen · Demonstration data','The approved workplace displayed in the factory-wide production monitor','The displayed 30% utilization is demonstration data, not a customer measurement or operating result.','Actual Flowmatic production monitor showing existing and newly registered workplaces, with utilization marked as demonstration data.']
